kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "server-reverse-rpc"
purpose: Server reverse RPC — 经 WebSocket 回调的带外审批与问题解析。
valid_scope[2]: src/app/server/ws.rs,src/app/server/runtime.rs
requirements[4]{req_id,title,statement}:
  rr1,"reverse-rpc-approval","ApprovalRequired 事件时，server MUST 向持有该 session 的所有 WS 连接广播 ServerFrame::ReverseRpc {type: approval, call_id, ...}；首个客户端响应胜出。"
  rr2,"reverse-rpc-question","QuestionRequired 事件时，server MUST 向所有 WS 连接广播 ServerFrame::ReverseRpc {type: question, call_id, ...}；同样首个响应胜出。"
  rr3,"call-id-lifecycle",每个 reverse RPC MUST 有 UUID call_id，在 HashMap 中注册 oneshot channel；超时（默认 60s）时 channel 收到 ApprovalTimeout 错误；应答时 channel 收到结果；消费后 MUST 移除条目。
  rr4,"no-conflict-arbitration",v1 MUST NOT 实现多客户端冲突仲裁；给定 call_id 的首个 ApproveTool 或 AnswerQuestion 胜出；同一 call_id 的后续响应 MUST 被静默忽略。
scenarios[0]:
